# Lazarus C2 DNS and IP Detection (Operation Dream Job)
# Author: Actioner | Date: 2026-08-16
# Reference: https://research.checkpoint.com/2026/shattering-the-dream-when-a-job-offer-becomes-a-zero-day-attack/

alert dns $HOME_NET any -> any any (msg:"Actioner - Lazarus Troy C2 DNS Query for envell.xyz"; flow:to_server; dns.query; content:"envell.xyz"; nocase; fast_pattern; classtype:trojan-activity; reference:url,research.checkpoint.com/2026/shattering-the-dream-when-a-job-offer-becomes-a-zero-day-attack/; metadata:author Actioner, created_at 2026-08-16; sid:2200001; rev:1;)
